WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.265
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Few-Shot Prompts: Give Examples.

2
00:00:06.565 --> 00:00:12.723
Teach the AI your style with examples. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:13.717 --> 00:00:19.460
Step one. Few-shot means giving examples. Start with one example of what you want.

4
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:24.870
Step two. Add a second example. Two or three examples are enough.

5
00:00:25.883 --> 00:00:29.964
Step three. Now give a new input, in the same pattern.

6
00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:38.110
Step four. The AI follows your pattern and gives the same style. Use this for lists, emails and labels.

7
00:00:39.117 --> 00:00:42.872
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:43.172 --> 00:00:46.216
Teach the AI to write sentences with new words.

9
00:00:46.516 --> 00:00:49.503
Use 2 examples for a product description.

10
00:00:49.803 --> 00:00:52.487
Compare with a prompt that has no examples.

11
00:00:52.787 --> 00:00:53.870
Well done!

